msgid "A conditional mapping splits an account of this line by cost center or project. Open the General Ledger for one account."
msgstr "Pemetaan bersyarat membagi akun di baris ini menurut pusat biaya atau proyek. Buka Buku Besar per akun."

#: frappe_psak_id/psak_id/doctype/psak_id_financial_statement/psak_id_financial_statement.py:104
msgid "A final statement is not cancelled. Use Reopen: it keeps this version and creates a new one to correct."
msgstr "Laporan Final tidak dibatalkan. Gunakan Buka Kembali: versi ini tetap disimpan dan dibuat versi baru untuk dikoreksi."

#: frappe_psak_id/psak_id/doctype/psak_id_report_line/psak_id_report_line.py:76
msgid "A line cannot take its amount from itself."
msgstr "Pos tidak dapat mengambil jumlah dari dirinya sendiri."

#. Description of the 'Report Line' (Link) field in DocType 'PSAK ID Account
#. Mapping'
#: frappe_psak_id/psak_id/doctype/psak_id_account_mapping/psak_id_account_mapping.json:73
msgid "A profit or loss line for income and expense accounts; a financial position line of the same category for asset, liability and equity accounts."
msgstr "Pos laba rugi untuk akun pendapatan dan beban; pos posisi keuangan dengan kategori yang sama untuk akun aset, liabilitas, dan ekuitas."

#: frappe_psak_id/psak_id/doctype/psak_id_financial_statement/psak_id_financial_statement.py:92
msgid "A statement becomes final only when the CFO approves it."
msgstr "Laporan menjadi Final hanya setelah disetujui CFO."

#: frappe_psak_id/psak_id/doctype/psak_id_report_line/psak_id_report_line.py:142
msgid "A subtotal cannot refer to itself."
msgstr "Subtotal tidak boleh merujuk dirinya sendiri."

